Ready to Take the Field?

Fyld is a Portuguese consulting company specializing in IT services.

We bring high-performance professionals into the field across a wide range of technological areas.

Inspired by sports management philosophy, we strive to achieve peak performance with each of our consultants.

We focus on training and excellence.

Join us for the next game!

We Are Looking For Our Next Node Developer

Bachelor's degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field is preferred;

Minimum of 3 years of experience as a Node.Js Developer or in a similar role;

Proven track record of developing and deploying Node.Js applications;

Proficiencyin Node.Js and its frameworks such as Express.Js;

Experience with front-end technologies such as HTML, CSS, JavaScript and React;

Knowledge of database systems such as MongoDB, MySQL, or PostgreSQL;

Ability to design, develop, and implement RESTful APIs using Node.Js;

Experience with API integration and consumption;

Strong understanding of asynchronous programming and event-driven architecture in Node.Js;

Proficiencyin version control tools such as Git;

Experience with testing frameworks such as Mocha, Chai, or Jest;

Familiaritywith deployment platforms and DevOps practices;

Experience with containerization technologies like Docker is a plus;

Understanding of security best practices for web development and Node.Js applications;

Strong communication skills and ability to collaborate effectively in a team environment;

Experience working in Agile development environments is preferred;

Fluent in English

We Prioritize

